        "source_span": "2026 KGA 330.16; PDF 342; cpa_uploader/drafts/frequency-gap-2026-09-10/sources/kga-2026-pymupdf-pages.txt L14691~14695; 등록 cpa_uploader/data/official/kga330-2025-review07.txt L115~118"
      },
      {
